      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبِيجٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْبُوجٌ</span></b>  Milk <i>mixed up,</i> or <i>beaten
