       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبِيجٌ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَابِجَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A kind of food of the Arabs
